   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Opy Tocantins&apos; Women&apos;s Hospital and Maternity</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The transaction consists of a financing for the construction and operation of the new Tocantins Women&#x2019;s Hospital and Maternity, a 210-bed greenfield facility under a 30-year PPP awarded to Opy Health. The Project aims to expand access to high-quality maternal and women&#x2019;s healthcare through a modern public hospital, ensuring efficient delivery of non-clinical services for free and long-term infrastructure sustainability.</narrative>
  </description>
